2. Bus line disconnection;
3. Bus interference;
4. Abnormality in the integrated brake controller;
5. Fault of the integrated brake controller
6. Network node random hardware failure; 
7. Other causes: such as condensation inside the controller, water droplets condensing or evaporating, grounding interference, etc.;

