1. { Set a factory status flag to indicate the factory state. This flag defaults to unprogrammed, and 0xF00051 shows the current DTC.
   AND
  When calibration data is successfully written to the ECU, the flag status changes to configured, and DTC 0xF00051 shows the historical DTC}
OR
2. 
{ The flag status changes to unprogrammed, and 0xF00051 records the current DTC when the following conditions are met: 
 The calibration data has been erased;
 OR
  The calibration data was not successfully written to the ECU.}
